MAX q coverable by 13 danger-sets (greedy search): B = 129

If B is a small constant => every free modulus q>B has a witness => the census
q_min <= max(first_free_modulus, B) = O(log M). The compressed crux is CLOSED to
`no covering above B` = a FINITE, magnitude-independent covering fact.
